  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Traceability Programme for the Agro-Industrial Sector - Preparatory Assistance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNIDO has been requested to assist with the design and implementation of a traceability system for the agro-industrial sector of Ecuador. Such assistance will enable Ecuador to export traceable products to markets such as Europe, the United States of America and Japan, while ensuring compliance with international standards and conformity assessment requirements.</narrative>
  </description>
